bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Avatar Menu" as UI
boundary Router
control AuthController

User -> UI: 1. Click Logout
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. POST /api/auth/logout (cookie)
activate Router

Router -> Router: 3. Check token
activate Router
space
deactivate Router

opt Invalid / expired token
    Router --> UI: 3.1. Show error
    UI --> User: 3.2. Logout failed
end

Router -> AuthController: 4. logout()
activate AuthController

AuthController -> AuthController: 5. Clear cookie
activate AuthController
space
deactivate AuthController

opt Exception while clearing cookie
    AuthController --> Router: 5.1. 400 BadRequest
    Router --> UI: 5.2. Show error
    UI --> User: 5.3. Logout failed
end

AuthController --> Router: 6. { success: true }
deactivate AuthController

Router --> UI: 7. Logout response
deactivate Router

UI --> User: 8. Redirect login
deactivate UI
deactivate User